WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:06.690
The princess is quite angry
over your lack of ability.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.690
She commands you to
visit St. Valeria tomorrow,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.010
where you are to offer
prayers of repentance.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.870
However...

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.420
intel indicates that this individual may have infiltrated Ansullivan.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.160
This former mountain guerrilla terrorist.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.210
Avdocha, She Who Condemns.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:32.760
St. Valeria once said,
"Hate the sin, but love the sinner."

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.260
Death to all sinners!

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:41.180
I am Avdocha, She Who Condemns!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.720
What's with that smoke?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.420
It's coming from St. Valeria.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.080
No way!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.190
Princess, let us return to the <i>Sylvanus</i>.

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.080
Wait! Don't you see that?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.530
The princess might be in there!

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.720
Never fear.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:43.000
We'll make the Magiship <i>Sylvanus</i> our strategic headquarters.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:52.200
Incoming transmission
from St. Valeria Church.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.110
Go ahead.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.110
Long time no see,

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.360
Veronica Lautreamont.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.920
I should have known
you were behind this,

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.510
Avdocha, She Who Condemns.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.120
Huh? Could it be...

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.260
It's someone else entirely!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.370
Why did you take over the church?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.500
Are you after my head again?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.340
Yes, and you have no choice.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.510
Look at this!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.350
Jessica!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.270
Is that...

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:38.450
An Imperial mechanical bomb.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:42.280
If it goes off, this church
will be blown to smithereens.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.280
What's more,

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:47.260
I'm not what you'd call
a patient person.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.230
Every time the church bell tolls,

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.540
I'm going to kill a hostage.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.590
What?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.040
There's less than an hour
until the next bell.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.220
I look forward to having your head.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.090
Your Highness?

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.350
I refuse to give in to terrorists.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:15.480
If necessary, the <i>Sylvanus</i> can blow away the whole church and everyone in it.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.110
You wouldn't!

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.710
Don't get worked up, boy.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.020
Stay vigilant!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.460
Who knows what that woman will do?

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.030
<i>Jessica...</i>

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.300
Wait.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:45.300
Who knows what she'll do to you if she finds out that you're Princess Veronica's sister?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:50.000
But if I reveal who I am and demand that the hostages be released...

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:55.010
I know you want to help,
but you must not sacrifice yourself.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.800
Now hear this!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:04.080
I am Jessica Valentine.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:07.820
Despite all appearances, I am
well-known Lautreamont nobility.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.950
Out of respect for my name,

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.120
swear you won't lay a finger on the remaining hostages.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.790
Valentine, you say?

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.830
Never heard of 'em.
Still, if you insist.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.600
<i>And then, even as
they tore her clothes off,</i>

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.380
<i>even as they tied her up,</i>

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>she didn't say a word or shed a tear.</i>

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.970
<i>Jessica...</i>

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:36.440
<i>You're a far higher-minded woman than any noble in these parts.</i>

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.730
<i>On the other hand, I...</i>

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.030
<i>That's Avdocha, She Who Condemns.</i>

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:52.200
<i>If I tell her I'm a fellow Tantalos...</i>

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.670
<i>No, I'd better not.</i>

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>I'll take a wait-and-see
approach for now.</i>

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.440
I just came looking for my friends.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.560
What have I gotten myself into?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.960
A firefight? Are you serious?!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.150
Calm down, Ash Blake!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.070
Princess Veronica, I have an idea.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.670
Yes? What is it?

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:33.580
I see. Interesting.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:39.790
Lady Avdocha!

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:47.840
Ash Blake,

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.090
we're sending you to
the church as a negotiator.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.220
What?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.640
Now hang on!

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.930
Why are you sending him
somewhere so dangerous?

00:06:55.930 --> 00:07:01.190
They have no idea that Ash is
capable of Archdragonar-level power.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.190
While he buys us time inside the church,

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.950
we Archdragonars will
use the underground passage

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:11.560
and break through the church's foundation from below.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.860
I get it.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.580
What do you think, Ash?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.400
Sounds like a plan.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.260
Good. Now for a strategy meeting.

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.730
Hey, Eco...

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.780
What?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:28.670
I have a favor to ask. For the next Arch you make for me...

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.700
What? I can't-

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.500
Sure, you can.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.790
I <i>know</i> you can.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.270
I'm counting on you.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.690
This means triple the crepes.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.850
Sure. But hold the anthar.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:47.730
Halt!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.260
I'm Ash Blake, and I've been
sent here to negotiate.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:54.950
I seek entry!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.430
<i>Ash!</i>

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:16.090
They sent a brat like you to negotiate?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.930
They must not think much of me.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.100
The <i>Sylvanus</i> has its largest gun aimed right at this church.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.690
The princess will not yield to terrorists.

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:29.440
Silence!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.930
You're not much of a negotiator, are you,

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.130
terrifying the hostages like that?

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:40.700
Enough pointless resistance.
You don't want to die for nothing!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.830
The truth is...

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.590
I'm here looking for my long-lost sister.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:53.090
I understand Veronica has
three sisters of her own.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:59.430
She should know the sorrow of being torn from her beloved siblings.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.190
<i>This isn't working.
She'll never negotiate.</i>

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.190
<i>Eco, please! Hurry!</i>

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:10.940
I'm working on it!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.480
I'm working on it, but it's not easy.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:20.200
Just slap together an original Arch already.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.840
L-Like I'd bother for the likes of him!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:26.830
He can ride any dragon.
It's very mysterious.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:31.840
He should be riding you too,
in your true form.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.690
My true form?

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:38.170
While this human form is your reality,

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:42.160
you are of the dragon race,
and Ash Blake's Pal.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.150
It's high time you realized that.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.600
Geez! Be quiet! I can't work!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.610
One day you'll understand.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.730
I have my hands full with this.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:58.360
He asked me for an Arch that can stop a mechanical bomb.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.870
<i>Ash Blake.</i>

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.280
<i>I'll remember that name.</i>

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.350
<i>Wh-What? You want to nurse?!</i>

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.590
<i>But there's nothing in there!</i>

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.100
<i>No! No squirming allowed!</i>

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.350
What's that racket?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.780
Very well.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:36.380
This one should be
good and hungry too.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:40.910
It's a bit early, but that woman and her baby will be the first sacrifice.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.920
No!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.830
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.070
<i>Wait!</i>

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.590
What?! Are you crazy?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.690
Who are <i>you</i>?

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.800
I-I am...

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.030
I am the fourth princess of the
Lautreamont royal knight family,

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:27.540
Silvia Lautreamont!

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:32.040
Oh? Fourth princess, you say?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.800
Out of respect for my name,

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.350
release these two at once!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.550
What's she doing?

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:44.760
That fool.

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.310
So you must be Veronica's sister.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.600
No! Don't touch her!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:00.570
Silence!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.370
If you're volunteering
your name like that,

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:06.080
you must be ready
for what comes next.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.170
I-I am a princess!

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:11.910
I can't just stand by and watch my people be slaughtered!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.580
I wish to die a knight's death!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.580
That's the spirit!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.360
Princess!

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:39.690
There's your true form.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:45.200
Just by revealing your nudity,
you go back to being a woman.

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:49.280
Gone is the prestige of
your knightly name,

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.700
along with any point in killing you.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.960
You disappoint me.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.860
"One must do one's utmost,
no matter the contest."

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.550
That is my family motto.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:01.960
That's all.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:07.340
Why are you standing around
and chatting here, of all places?

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.130
Don't you realize how annoying that is?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.570
What was that?

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:12.960
She's getting carried away
just because she's royalty.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.390
Like brother, like sister.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.480
Sorry, Your Highness. It was my fau-

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.650
All this horsing around on dragons is out of the question!

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:24.080
Now calm down!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.200
Behave yours-

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.650
You've displayed such great ineptitude.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:38.080
And you count yourself part of the House of Lautreamont?

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.340
That's you in a nutshell.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.170
You act pretentious, but really, you're nothing but a little girl.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.930
Never mind your Dragonar ambition.

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:51.340
It's far more appropriate
for you to settle down!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.770
<i>I wasn't prepared.</i>

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:59.770
If you don't like it, you'll have to surpass Princess Veronica.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.650
<i>I expect my elder sister
to scold me, sure...</i>

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.530
<i>but...</i>

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:08.780
I'll carry you, and we'll look for the Mother Dragon together!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.900
<i>I made that boy a promise.</i>

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.160
<i>That I'd be a fine, upstanding knight.</i>

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.610
I must thank you, Avdocha.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.090
What?

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:25.800
You made me realize how
weak and ill-prepared I am.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.880
But the old me is gone.
She died when you cut her down.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:31.800
And now...

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:42.640
I am reborn as a new
Silvia Lautreamont!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.320
This I declare.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:53.830
I will be that most
royal knight: a paladin!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.580
Well said, Silvia!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.300
We're under enemy attack!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.540
O ye sure-striking mystic spear...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.590
Its name: Gae Bulg!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:14.640
O ye lightning-quick mystic brand...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.930
Its name: Caladbolg!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.440
Don't toy with me, brat!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.320
Ash!

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:48.670
Ash!

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:50.380
Sorry about the wait.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.930
Right on time!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.930
Thanks, Eco.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.940
I didn't do it for you.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.070
Not so fast!

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.260
Stop right there!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:13.320
Unless you want me to
push this detonator button!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.450
Nice try!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:17.820
Manifest now, O ye
sacred glacial carbine...

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:18.970
Its name:

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.280
Brionac!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.850
W-Wait! I...

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.540
Oh my!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.630
I guess those stories are
good for something.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.340
The Heavenly Dragonar...

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.870
Sir Ash!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:28.610
Huh?

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.040
We meet at last, Sir Silver Knight.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.620
J-Jessica?!

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.650
Now to plant your seed in me.

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.120
Keep 'em on!

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:48.540
I decided that our first time
would be on the church altar.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.520
Liar. You just came up with that now!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.720
Off with your clothes, Sir Ash!

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.130
Are you even listening?

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:56.170
Cut that out.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.880
Rebecca!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.110
Off with you.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.440
Are you all right?

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.700
My legs have to buckle <i>now</i>,
of all times. Pitiful.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:22.950
Not at all.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.290
You were amazing.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.910
Th-That's preposterous!

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:30.600
Come on.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.550
Don't be shy.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.860
<i>Why is it?</i>

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.680
<i>Why do I feel a sense of nostalgia...</i>

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:54.070
<i>when Ash carries me like this?</i>

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:16.540
Panties...

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.490
J-Jessica?!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:27.100
I'm here to form a relationship for our posterity, Sir Ash!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.560
H-How did you get in?!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.830
I'm fully prepared.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.100
Why'd you take off your panties first?!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.770
Oh, I can take off my top too.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.110
That wasn't my point.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.330
D-Didn't you say...

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:40.110
your first time would be
on the church altar?

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:45.870
I'm willing to abandon my principles at any time for you, Sir Ash!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.800
No, stick to them!

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:48.830
Please! Spare me!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.330
Sir Ash, I <i>will</i> have
your seed this time!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.880
W-Wait! Stop!

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:58.840
Sir Ash, Sir Ash, you're so hot!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:19:59.880
No! Not there!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.820
What should we name our child?

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:13.980
Figured as much.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:18.150
Thought I'd check here since you were gone from the girls' dormitory.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.000
What?!

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.870
Jessica's joining the Student Council?!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:44.510
Yes, because she learned
who the Silver Knight really is.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.790
We made her quit as
president of the fan club

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:50.220
and had her join our group instead.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.900
Call it leak prevention.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:58.520
Let's hurry. Princess Veronica is waiting.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.530
I am Avdocha, She Who Condemns.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.300
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.990
It was all my elder sister's scheme.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.040
Scheme?

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:15.540
To correct my unworthy sister.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.310
Wait, so you knew?

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.260
I wasn't totally sure, though.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.550
As you know,

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:26.010
I was once part of
an antigovernment group,

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:29.050
where I failed at assassinating Veronica five years ago.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:33.790
After that, I surrendered to her
and began working as her agent.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.250
That's the shape of it.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.060
Talk about eating humble pie.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:40.970
B-But you look completely different on your wanted poster.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.840
One of my people made that based on complete hearsay.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.420
The timing was right, so I let it be.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.700
But why would you work
for Princess Veronica?

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.130
To find my long-lost sister.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:57.080
Her name is Shamara,
and she turns fifteen this year.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:00.920
So the part about
your sister <i>was</i> true.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:06.050
I can't give up until I find her.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:10.050
We got to hear this
little tidbit, thanks to you.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:13.810
I will be that most
royal knight: a paladin!

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:17.550
S-Stop that!

00:22:17.550 --> 00:22:18.790
Master Ash?

00:22:19.780 --> 00:22:23.900
Do you know where the
Magiship <i>Sylvanus</i> gets its name?

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:25.190
Where?

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:27.210
Don't the names sound similar?

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:29.450
<i>Sylvanus</i> and Silvia?

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:32.950
I see.

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:33.590
Veronica! Enough already!

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:36.140
That takes some real
sisterly love, doesn't it?

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:38.010
Are you making fun of your little sister?

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:40.440
Please, stop laughing and answer me!

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:51.530
During that incident, Princess Veronica mobilized a detached force

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:56.980
and rounded up a bunch of Avdocha-inspired agitators.

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:02.910
All those results from a single action.

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:05.730
I still have a long way to go.

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.830
I think you'll be fine.

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:09.740
Huh?

00:23:11.010 --> 00:23:12.490
Well, see...

00:24:54.600 --> 00:24:56.990
Sir Ash! Sir Ash! Sir Silver Knight!

00:24:56.990 --> 00:24:58.890
Stop it, Jessica! You promised
to keep that secret!

00:24:58.890 --> 00:25:02.200
Whatever do you mean?
We have no secrets between us.

00:25:02.200 --> 00:25:03.180
Are we talking about the same thing?

00:25:03.180 --> 00:25:05.380
Now, then, let's get that seed planted!

00:25:05.380 --> 00:25:06.780
Uh, see you next week!

00:25:06.780 --> 00:25:07.510
To make babies?

00:25:07.510 --> 00:25:08.490
No!
